  "title": "Union of Utrecht",
  "summary": "On 23 January 1579 six northern Dutch provinces made a political agreement, the Union of Utrecht, signed in the chapter house of Utrecht's Dom. They agreed to fight the Spanish together and not to make separate terms with Philip II. It was later regarded as the cornerstone of the Republic.",
